            <p>Klimaatgrafiek</p>
            <p>
              <img id="Id-IMG_53a6d0aa-b1f7-4ab5-a1aa-0f9ce9c06dd4" src="../img/akbb232cbt-31_Orenburg.jpg" width="206" height="241" alt=""/>
